</span></li>\n</ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\"\ndata-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\"\ndata-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Building\nAgentic AI applications&nbsp;</span><span\ndata-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245417&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:220,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\"\ndata-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\"\ndata-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Design and\nimplement tracking and evaluation tools to assess model performance and data\naccuracy, focusing on product relevance based on user interaction\nfeedback</span><span\ndata-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:220,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\"\ndata-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\"\ndata-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span\ndata-contrast=\"none\">Implementing appropriate ML algorithms</span><span\ndata-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:220,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\"\ndata-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\"\ndata-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span\ndata-contrast=\"none\">Orchestration of long running jobs for data\nextraction</span><span\ndata-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:220,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\"\ndata-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\"\ndata-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Building\nUIs to test &amp; evaluate results of ML experiments</span><span\ndata-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:220,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\"\ndata-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\"\ndata-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Translate\nresearch papers into high-quality, production-ready code</span><span\ndata-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:220,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\"\ndata-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\"\ndata-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Ship code\nto production frequently</span><span\ndata-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:220,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"Poppins\" data-listid=\"3\"\ndata-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\"\ndata-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Coach and\nmentor more junior engineers</span><span\ndata-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:220,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">What Success Looks like in 12\nmonths:</span></strong><span\ndata-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;134245417&quot;:fal